        "status": "present",
        "value": "best starts with best[0][0] = grid[0][0]. For each step from 1 to 2n-2, build a fresh table: for row1 from first to last valid row and row2 from row1 to last, skip thorns, take the maximum of best[row1][row2], best[row1-1][row2], best[row1][row2-1] (if row2 > row1) and best[row1-1][row2-1], skip if unreachable, and add the two cells (once if row1 == row2). The answer is max(0, best[n-1][n-1])."
      },
